1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,406
Exam tip.

2
00:00:01,406 --> 00:00:06,549
Cold concentrated acid only dissolves ether as an oxonium salt.

3
00:00:06,549 --> 00:00:13,580
Hot excess hydrogen iodide breaks both bonds, giving two iodoalkanes and water.

4
00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:18,541
And anisole with H I always gives phenol and iodomethane.

